{"id": "EUVD-2026-95694", "enisaUuid": "b40660e0-21fc-32d4-a420-7b4b029e265e", "description": "The max_age authentication-freshness check in OidcClientCodeRequestFilter was inoperative due to a milliseconds/seconds unit mismatch and an inverted comparison polarity. Any relying party using setMaxAgeOffset to enforce re-authentication would silently accept sessions of any age, bypassing step-up authentication policies. Users are recommended to upgrade to versions 4.2.4 or 4.1.9 or 3.6.13, which fix this issue.", "datePublished": "2026-10-09T10:17:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T16:07:39", "baseScore": 9.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://lists.apache.org/thread/p1r9t4xl8ny7rg8wmj8nrygx35ds6vcs"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-71575", "GHSA-8ph5-3q2c-4cc7"], "assigner": "apache", "epss": 0.37, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6b9b1146-c901-374b-a320-ece1b9a00d7c", "product": {"name": "Apache CXF", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.2.0 <4.2.4"}, {"id": "7620845a-2982-37f0-8213-d714853a549e", "product": {"name": "Apache CXF", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.6.13"}, {"id": "bb67c757-ca3e-3859-8c05-de671e3e6617", "product": {"name": "Apache CXF", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}, "product_version": "4.0.0 <4.1.9"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b39f0999-ffaf-37f3-b839-705ef36ec3ad", "vendor": {"name": "Apache Software Foundation"}}], "isExploited": false}